#: ../../source/administration-guide/manage/admin/self-hosted-billing.rst:7
msgid ""
"Mattermost commercial plans are offered as an annual subscription "
"service. With your purchase you're provided with a license key. Depending"
" on which version of Mattermost you're on, you may have to download and "
"apply this license manually via the System Console."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/manage/admin/self-hosted-billing.rst:9
msgid ""
"When you upgrade to commercial plan, the number of user seats you need "
"has to be equal to or greater than your current number of activated users"
" (formerly called active users)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/manage/admin/self-hosted-billing.rst:11
msgid ""
"You can add new users to your deployment at any time. Every quarter, "
"during the true-up review (section 3.5 License True-up Review of Software"
" License Agreement, also referenced in docs), we check the license "
"license seat count relative to number of activated users. If there's a "
"difference, we'll provide you with a new invoice which is payable "
"immediately."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/manage/admin/self-hosted-billing.rst:13
msgid ""
"Please see the :ref:`self-hosted subscriptions documentation <product-"
"overview/self-hosted-subscriptions:buy a subscription>` for more detailed"
" information."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/manage/admin/self-hosted-billing.rst:15
msgid ""
